ne with some competitors, David Friedland, co-head of North =0AAmerica inve=
stment banking, said in an interview.=0A=0AI thought a two-year path to ass=
ociate was pretty standard these days. I=E2=80=99m =0Aalso not quite sure h=
ow this works to compete with private equity. Like the =0Atimeline is:=0A=
